              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## CHAT HISTORY\n<chatHistory>{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}</chatHistory>\n\n## ATTACHMENTS\n<attachments>{{$context.$app.$OraAttachments}}</attachments>\n\n## DATA\n{{$context.$nodes.TEAM_RATINGS.$output}}\n\n## INSTRUCTIONS\n- Answer the Question to the best of your knowledge based on data available to you.\n- Refer the attachments if the user is asking question about the attachments.\n\n## QUESTION\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}"
